        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2><a id="1%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>1. 标题</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown"># 一级标题<h2 id="二级标题"><a href="#二级标题" class="headerlink" title="二级标题"></a>二级标题</h2><h3 id="三级标题"><a href="#三级标题" class="headerlink" title="三级标题"></a>三级标题</h3><h4 id="四级标题"><a href="#四级标题" class="headerlink" title="四级标题"></a>四级标题</h4><h5 id="五级标题"><a href="#五级标题" class="headerlink" title="五级标题"></a>五级标题</h5><h6 id="六级标题"><a href="#六级标题" class="headerlink" title="六级标题"></a>六级标题</h6><p></code></pre></p><p>效果：</p><h1><a id="%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>一级标题</h1><h2><a id="%E4%BA%8C%E7%BA%A7%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>二级标题</h2><h3><a id="%E4%B8%89%E7%BA%A7%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>三级标题</h3><hr><h1><a id="2%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>2. 字体</h1><h2><a id="%E5%8A%A0%E7%B2%97" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>加粗</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">**加粗文字**</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p><strong>加粗文字</strong></p><h2><a id="%E6%96%9C%E4%BD%93" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>斜体</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">*斜体文字*</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p><em>斜体文字</em></p><h2><a id="%E5%8A%A0%E7%B2%97%E6%96%9C%E4%BD%93" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>加粗斜体</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">***加粗斜体***</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p><em><strong>加粗斜体</strong></em></p><h2><a id="%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E7%BA%BF" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>删除线</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">~~删除文字~~</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p><del>删除文字</del></p><hr><h1><a id="3%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E7%BA%BF" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>3. 分割线</h1><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">---<hr><hr><p></code></pre></p><p>效果：</p><hr><hr><h1><a id="4%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>4. 引用</h1><h2><a id="%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>一级引用</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">&gt; 这是引用内容</code></pre><p>效果：</p><blockquote><p>这是引用内容</p></blockquote><h2><a id="%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>多级引用</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">&gt; 一级引用&gt;&gt;&gt; 二级引用&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; 三级引用</code></pre><hr><h1><a id="5%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>5. 列表</h1><h2><a id="%E6%97%A0%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>无序列表</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">- 苹果- 香蕉- 西瓜</code></pre><p>效果：</p><ul><li>苹果</li><li>香蕉</li><li>西瓜</li></ul><h2><a id="%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>多级列表</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">- 一级<ul><li><p>二级</p><ul><li>三级</li></ul></li></ul><p></code></pre></p><h2><a id="%E6%9C%89%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>有序列表</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">1. 第一项2. 第二项3. 第三项</code></pre><h2><a id="%E6%B7%B7%E5%90%88%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>混合列表</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">1. Linux<ul><li>Ubuntu</li><li>CentOS</li></ul><ol start="2"><li><p>Windows</p><ul><li>Windows10</li><li>Windows11</li></ul></li></ol><p></code></pre></p><hr><h1><a id="6%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>6. 任务列表</h1><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">- [x] 完成安装- [ ] 配置环境- [ ] 发布博客</code></pre><p>效果：</p><ul><li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" checked="" disabled=""> 完成安装</li><li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" disabled=""> 配置环境</li><li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" disabled=""> 发布博客</li></ul><hr><h1><a id="7%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>7. 链接</h1><h2><a id="%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>普通链接</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">[百度](https://www.baidu.com)</code></pre><h2><a id="%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>自动链接</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">&lt;https://www.baidu.com&gt;</code></pre><hr><h1><a id="8%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>8. 图片</h1><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">![图片名称](图片地址)</code></pre><p>示例：</p><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">![Markdown](https://markdown-here.com/img/icon256.png)</code></pre><hr><h1><a id="9%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>9. 表格</h1><h2><a id="%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>普通表格</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">| 名称 | 类型 | 描述 || ---- | ---- | ---- || CPU | 硬件 | 处理器 || GPU | 硬件 | 显卡 |</code></pre><p>效果：</p><table><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>描述</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>CPU</td><td>硬件</td><td>处理器</td></tr><tr><td>GPU</td><td>硬件</td><td>显卡</td></tr></tbody></table><h2><a id="%E5%AF%B9%E9%BD%90%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>对齐表格</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">| 参数 | 值 || :--- | ---: || CPU | 32核 || 内存 | 128G |</code></pre><p>效果：</p><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align: left">参数</th><th style="text-align: right">值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align: left">CPU</td><td style="text-align: right">32核</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align: left">内存</td><td style="text-align: right">128G</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h1><a id="10%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>10. 代码</h1><h2><a id="%E8%A1%8C%E5%86%85%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>行内代码</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">使用 `docker ps` 查看容器</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p>使用 <code>docker ps</code> 查看容器</p><h2><a id="%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%9D%97" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>代码块</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-bash">docker ps<p>docker images<br></code></pre></p><p>支持：</p><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-text">bashpythonjavajavascriptjsonyamlsqldockerfilexmlnginx</code></pre><hr><h1><a id="11-json%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>11. JSON示例</h1><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-json">&#123;  "name": "ChatGPT",  "version": "1.0",  "enabled": true&#125;</code></pre><hr><h1><a id="12-yaml%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>12. YAML示例</h1><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-yaml">server:  port: 8080<p>database:<br>  host: localhost<br>  username: root<br></code></pre></p><hr><h1><a id="13-python%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>13. Python示例</h1><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-python">def hello():    print("Hello Markdown")    <p>hello()<br></code></pre></p><hr><h1><a id="14-latex%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>14. LaTeX数学公式</h1><h2><a id="%E8%A1%8C%E5%86%85%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>行内公式</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">$a+b=c$</code></pre><h2><a id="%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>独立公式</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">$$E=mc^2$$</code></pre><h2><a id="%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>复杂公式</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">$$\frac&#123;-b\pm\sqrt&#123;b^2-4ac&#125;&#125;&#123;2a&#125;$$</code></pre><hr><h1><a id="15-html" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>15. HTML</h1><h2><a id="%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%92%E7%BA%BF" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>下划线</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-html">&lt;u&gt;下划线文字&lt;/u&gt;</code></pre><h2><a id="%E9%A2%9C%E8%89%B2" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>颜色</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-html">&lt;span style="color:red"&gt;红色文字&lt;/span&gt;</code></pre><h2><a id="%E5%B1%85%E4%B8%AD" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>居中</h2><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-html">&lt;center&gt;居中文字&lt;/center&gt;</code></pre><hr><h1><a id="16%E6%8A%98%E5%8F%A0%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>16. 折叠内容</h1><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-html">&lt;details&gt;<p>&lt;summary&gt;<br>点击展开<br>&lt;&#x2F;summary&gt;</p><p>这里是隐藏内容</p><p>&lt;&#x2F;details&gt;<br></code></pre></p><p>效果：</p><details><summary>点击展开</summary><p>这里是隐藏内容</p></details><hr><h1><a id="17-emoji" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>17. Emoji</h1><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">🚀 发布<p>🔥 热门</p><p>⚠️ 警告</p><p>✅ 完成</p><p>❌ 错误</p><p>📌 注意<br></code></pre></p><hr><h1><a id="18-mermaid%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%9B%BE" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>18. Mermaid流程图</h1><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-mermaid">flowchart LR<p>A[用户] –&gt; B[API网关]</p><p>B –&gt; C[AI模型]</p><p>C –&gt; D[返回结果]<br></code></pre></p><hr><h1><a id="19-mermaid%E6%97%B6%E5%BA%8F%E5%9B%BE" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>19. Mermaid时序图</h1><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-mermaid">sequenceDiagram<p>用户-&gt;&gt;网关: 请求</p><p>网关-&gt;&gt;模型: 转发</p><p>模型–&gt;&gt;网关: 返回</p><p>网关–&gt;&gt;用户: 响应<br></code></pre></p><hr><h1><a id="20-mermaid%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E5%9B%BE" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>20. Mermaid架构图</h1><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-mermaid">graph TD<p>A[客户端]</p><p>B[安全网关]</p><p>C[AI模型]</p><p>D[数据库]</p><p>A –&gt; B</p><p>B –&gt; C</p><p>B –&gt; D<br></code></pre></p><hr><h1><a id="21%E8%84%9A%E6%B3%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>21. 脚注</h1><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">这里是一句话说明[^1]<p></code></pre></p><hr><h1><a id="22%E9%94%9A%E7%82%B9%E8%B7%B3%E8%BD%AC" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>22. 锚点跳转</h1><p>定义：</p><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-html">&lt;a name="top"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</code></pre><p>跳转：</p><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">[返回顶部](#top)</code></pre><hr><h1><a id="23%E9%94%AE%E7%9B%98%E6%8C%89%E9%94%AE" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>23. 键盘按键</h1><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-html">&lt;kbd&gt;Ctrl&lt;/kbd&gt; + &lt;kbd&gt;C&lt;/kbd&gt;</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p><kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>C</kbd></p><hr><h1><a id="24%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E5%9D%97" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>24. 提示块</h1><p>部分编辑器支持：</p><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-markdown">&gt; [!NOTE]&gt; 注意内容<p>&gt; [!WARNING]<br>&gt; 警告内容</p><h2 id="TIP-技巧内容25-Hexo文章模板-title-我的技术文章date-2026-08-04categories-技术tags-Docker-Linuxcover-images-demo-png"><a href="#TIP-技巧内容25-Hexo文章模板-title-我的技术文章date-2026-08-04categories-技术tags-Docker-Linuxcover-images-demo-png" class="headerlink" title="&gt; [!TIP]&gt; 技巧内容25. Hexo文章模板---title: 我的技术文章date: 2026-08-04categories:  - 技术tags:  - Docker  - Linuxcover: /images/demo.png"></a>&gt; [!TIP]<br>&gt; 技巧内容<br></code></pre><br><hr><br><h1><a id="25-hexo%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>25. Hexo文章模板</h1><br><pre class="line-numbers"><code class="language-yaml">---<br>title: 我的技术文章<br>date: 2026-08-04<br>categories:<br>  - 技术<br>tags:<br>  - Docker<br>  - Linux<br>cover: /images/demo.png</h2><h1 id="标题"><a href="#标题" class="headerlink" title="标题"></a>标题</h1><h2 id="简介"><a href="#简介" class="headerlink" title="简介"></a>简介</h2><p>文章说明。</p><h2 id="环境"><a href="#环境" class="headerlink" title="环境"></a>环境</h2><table><thead><tr><th>软件</th><th>版本</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Ubuntu</td><td>24.04</td></tr><tr><td>Docker</td><td>28.0</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="安装"><a href="#安装" class="headerlink" title="安装"></a>安装</h2><pre><code class="bash">docker pull nginx&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;octicon octicon-link&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;架构&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;line-numbers&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-mermaid&quot;&gt;flowchart LRA--&amp;gt;B--&amp;gt;C&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;octicon octicon-link&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;总结&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;优点&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;缺点&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;注意事项&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;line-numbers&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-plain_text&quot;&gt;---# 常用快捷符号| 功能 | Markdown ||-|-|| 标题 | `#` || 加粗 | `**文字**` || 斜体 | `*文字*` || 删除 | `~~文字~~` || 引用 | `&amp;gt;` || 列表 | `-` || 代码 | `` `代码` `` || 链接 | `[名称](URL)` || 图片 | `![名称](URL)` || 表格 | `|---|` || 分割线 | `---` || 任务 | `- [ ]` |&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</code></pre>]]></content>
      
      
